selectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mn>25</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>25</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We cannot take the square root of a negative number. Therefore, the equation has no real solutions. \nSo, the hyperbola does not intersect the vertical line <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"144\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</div></div>",
